.catalog-cache/
node_modules/

# 🚨 The repository root ignores `*.bin` globally, which silently swallows the
# one file this cartridge cannot start without. Staged without this line, the
# commit looks complete — 42 files — and the installed cartridge reports that
# the catalogue could not be read, on every machine. Found by counting the
# staged files, not by anything failing.
!public/catalog/catalog.bin
